# $recipe bot-fix

Intro paragraph with **bold**, a [link](https://example.com) and a placeholder ${user.name}.
Nested placeholder ${a.${b}.c} and a call ${fn(a, b)} inline. Escaped: \${not.a.placeholder}, \$notsigil, \[x\], a\,b.
Template macro {{user}} is not a placeholder.

